{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\nTVB節目《一周星星》的「獨家考古」環節，重溫了胡楓（修哥）與羅蘭姐的經典片段，當中竟有驚人發現！羅蘭姐自爆當年飾演《神鵰俠侶》的經典角色「裘千尺」時，其恐怖造型竟遭親生媽媽極度嫌棄；而修哥一段攝於34年前的影片曝光，其驚人體能更是嚇窒網民！\n</p>\n<h2>羅蘭經典裘千尺造型竟遭母親嫌棄</h2>\n<p>節目重溫了羅蘭姐在1994年版《神鵰俠侶》中飾演「裘千尺」的片段，其光頭、牙齒疏落的造型至今仍是不少觀眾的童年陰影。羅蘭姐憶述，當年媽媽看到她的造型後反應極大，更嫌棄地說：「阿媽話『睇到你呢個樣，我就唔想睇，成個 TVB 咁大，冇人肯做，係你至做咋，傻嘅你！』」雖然不獲母親支持，但羅蘭姐坦言自己非常喜歡這個充滿挑戰性的角色，足見其專業精神。</p>\n<h2>胡楓60歲驚人體能曝光 做Sit Up不輸年輕人</h2>\n<p>另一邊廂，節目亦曝光了修哥在1992年《歡樂今宵》的片段。畫面中，當年已屆60歲的修哥，竟在節目中輕鬆完成多下仰臥起坐（Sit Up），體能狀態完全不輸時下年輕人，讓現場眾人為之讚嘆。對此，修哥只是謙虛地表示：「可能平時多行路、多做運動，所以有咁嘅效果。」數十年如一日的活力，實在令人佩服。</p>\n<h2>二人親述演戲學習對象</h2>\n<p>談到演戲心得，兩位前輩亦大方分享。修哥表示自己會透過觀看粵語片、西片以及細心觀察別人演戲來學習，不斷自我增值。而羅蘭姐則憶述，前輩梅綺對演戲的專業態度讓她印象極為深刻，成為她日後演藝生涯的學習榜樣。兩位常青樹對演藝事業的熱誠與追求，實在是後輩的典範。</p>\n<h2>網民洗版大讚回憶返哂嚟</h2>\n<p>這些珍貴的經典片段勾起了網民的集體回憶，並在網上洗版式討論。「裘千尺真係童年陰影！但羅蘭姐做得好好！」「原來羅蘭姐阿媽咁講，好搞笑！」「修哥60歲仲勁過我而家！太屈機！」「呢啲經典畫面真係百看不厭，回憶返哂嚟！」「兩位都係真心敬業嘅好演員，值得尊敬。」</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/02_9830315396af922c0a422b.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/02_9830315396af922c0a422b.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/09_3432588576af922f86f5db.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/09_3432588576af922f86f5db.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/10_6758223316af9230189ed2.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/10_6758223316af9230189ed2.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/11_12270945216af92309a0f16.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/11_12270945216af92309a0f16.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/12_3093904696af9231083df3.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/12_3093904696af9231083df3.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T15:02:48.977747+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1025,"images":5,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T14:30:56+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-15T15:16:37.096689+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T14:56:21.952840+00:00","content_hash":"1454e4f984aa9fff1f595de91c2cbfc4297c92f9062144e51f8e770a5724432a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}